    "directions": [
      "Cook the tapioca pieces in salted water and sieve out.",
      "Grind the cumin, turmeric powder, coconut, garlic, green chilies, and shallots coarsely.",
      "Mash the tapioca in a heavy bottomed pan and mix in the ground coconut on medium flame for about 3-4 minutes and then turn off the flame.",
      "in a small pan, for seasoning, heat oil, pop mustard seeds, add in curry leaves and fry the shallots till they are golden brown in color.",
      "mix the seasoning well into the cooked tapioca mix and garnish with chopped fresh coriander leaves."
    ],
